Seika_Inkbrush_House1_Text_Npc0::
	.string "A woman in a fine coat stayed in\n"
	.string "town last week.\p"
	.string "She paid in gold and spoke like\n"
	.string "a professor. Polite, but cold.\p"
	.string "She left for the west early one\n"
	.string "morning. Never said goodbye.$"

